  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access to lifesaving water, sanitation and hygiene services for vulnerable families with children in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National and local capacities are reinforced to deliver uninterrupted, lifesaving WASH (Water, Sanitation, and Hygiene) and heating services to war-affected communities, supporting a coordinated transition from emergency response to early recovery. This project will be softly earmarked so it remains flexible and responsive to sudden context changes.</narrative>
  </description>
